# `git.log`

Commit log up to `limit` entries.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.git.read`. ⚠️ sensitive — payload may carry secrets or git content.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `limit` | `number?` | no |

## Returns

`GitLogResponse` (JSON).

## Invoke

```
ship ops call git.log --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.
